  "description": "Thread-safe insertion-ordered cache with O(1) lookups, two-tier storage (bounded L1, unbounded L2), and async enumeration. Provides deletion-resilient iteration, automatic multi-consumer memory management, and zero-latency producer-consumer coordination using GuidV7 time-ordered identifiers. Ideal for event sourcing, audit logs, message queues, and time-series caching scenarios.",
